Z||000005||artherd||12-03-2001||03:14 AM||||JEESUS FLIRPIN JUMPERS! Eric: I knew the car was fast, but not *that* fast!!!<P>Add it to your sig, along with some pics  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>PS: I saw this car at last year's West Fest, it's very very nice, looks like it belongs there, and looks like it goes like the proverbial Bat out of the Neitherworld.<P>Best!<BR>Ben<P>PPS: Eric, I think you forgot the brakes!<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by West Coast Fiero:<BR><B>3.4 DOHC w/ Garret T3/T4 turbo, 9lbs boost<BR>last run in 1999 at Los Angeles County Race way - 11.98 at 139.4 mph</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
