Z||000007||88-DOHC||12-03-2001||03:57 AM||||Hey, any other info about what it took to do a turbo setup? Like what ECM did you end up using, etc..  I am currently toying with the idea of throwing a supercharger on mine, but kind of stuck when it comes to figuring out what kind of ECM to use. Granted a turbo setup is going to be different then a SC, but I believe you still have the problem of what computer to use.<P>BTW, I have Mike Smiths old car, but with the custom stuff that I was originally going to put on my old Fiero (13" brakes, 18" custom wheels, drop spindles, etc...).||||reg||1
