Z||000039||GTFiero1||12-05-2001||08:56 PM||||if i need reading glasses then im not 15! just thought id try and help<P>------------------<BR>Adam J. B.<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero_3.jpg">   <BR>you gotta keep on keepin on...<BR>IM AOL: GTFiero &  Rumpdetective (dont ask)||||reg||1
